    (16 : Eisenstein)^3 * rowProduct (neighbors 16) (values x y) (constants 16) - value root_16 x y ^ 3 =
      value F x y * value starA_16 x y + values x y 16 * value starB_16 x y :=
  identity_power (neighbors 16) nodes (constants 16) F starA_16 starB_16 root_16 16 16 3 (by decide +kernel) x y

